# Copy to .dev.vars to enable Google sign-in through Firebase.
# Firebase console -> Project settings -> Your apps -> Web app -> SDK setup.
# Authentication -> Sign-in method: enable Google.
# Authentication -> Settings -> Authorized domains: add http://localhost and
# your deployed origin.

# Public web app values; the browser uses them to start sign-in.
# FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=readshelf-1234
# FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:1234567890:web:abcdef123456
# FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=readshelf-1234.firebaseapp.com
